    {
      "id": "song-807",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浪淘沙",
      "subtitle": "又是春暮落花飞",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "又是春暮。\n落花飞絮。\n子规啼尽断肠声，秋千庭院，红旗彩索，淡烟疏雨。\n念念相思苦。\n黛眉长聚。\n碧池惊散睡鸳鸯，当初容易分飞去。\n恨孤儿欢侣。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "92e57b663a5c0f584efe4d9c02e12edc81daca77ed255c1414c61ea4407b7f27",
      "estimatedOutput": 744,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-807--92e57b663a5c0f584efe4d9c02e12edc81daca77ed255c1414c61ea4407b7f27.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-808",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浪淘沙",
      "subtitle": "帘外微风云雨回",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "帘外微风。\n云雨回踪。\n银釭烬冷锦帏中。\n枕上深盟，年少心事，陡顿成空。\n岭外白头翁。\n到没由逢。\n一床鸳被叠香红。\n明月满庭花似绣，闷不见虫虫。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f0fdfdf18380594526f373da937534fe162c67dad9ae915d7d97b82ae1fb13a8",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-808--f0fdfdf18380594526f373da937534fe162c67dad9ae915d7d97b82ae1fb13a8.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-809",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "更漏子",
      "subtitle": "庭远途程算万山",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "庭远途程。\n算万山千水，路入神京。\n暖日春郊，绿柳红杏，香迳舞燕流莺。\n客馆悄悄闲庭，堪惹旧恨深。\n有多少驱驱，蓦岭涉水，枉费身心。\n思想厚利高名。\n谩惹得忧烦，枉度浮生。\n幸有青松，白云深洞，清闲且乐升平。\n长是宦游羁思，别离泪满襟。\n望江乡踪迹，旧游题书，尚自分明。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d8fdd7d4748bd70c9a08ff962227be8667aeb678573f7e9d319c4db78753ffd3",
      "estimatedOutput": 870,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-809--d8fdd7d4748bd70c9a08ff962227be8667aeb678573f7e9d319c4db78753ffd3.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-810",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "生查子",
      "subtitle": "关山魂梦长寒雁",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "关山魂梦长，寒雁音书少。\n两鬓可怜青，只为相思老。\n归傍碧纱窗，说向人人道。\n真个别离难，不似相逢好。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "781763ca427fe2bcde0cb51f4756063cd04ebe591c9608d56b2cb3ab718ecaff",
      "estimatedOutput": 702,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-810--781763ca427fe2bcde0cb51f4756063cd04ebe591c9608d56b2cb3ab718ecaff.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-811",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "苏幕遮",
      "subtitle": "尽思量还叵耐因",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "尽思量，还叵耐。\n因甚当初，故故相招买。\n早是幽欢多障碍。\n更遣分飞，脉脉如天外。\n有心怜，无计奈。\n两处厌厌，一点虚恩爱。\n独上高楼临暮霭。\n凭暖朱阑，这意无人会。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ad27d408d6362387688ce4008bbc6dfbc3cffcc6b55dc8e45995462eff6083ec",
      "estimatedOutput": 766,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-811--ad27d408d6362387688ce4008bbc6dfbc3cffcc6b55dc8e45995462eff6083ec.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-812",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "渔家傲",
      "subtitle": "疏雨才收淡泞天",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "疏雨才收淡泞天。\n微云绽处月婵娟。\n寒雁一声人正远。\n添幽怨。\n那堪往事思量遍。\n谁道绸缪两意坚。\n水萍风絮不相缘。\n舞鉴鸾肠虚寸断。\n芳容变。\n好将憔悴教伊见。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "41d4acf17126be09c2b49bdda762b3a60aaf5eab3117f5c4f9ad3d4a92643a6a",
      "estimatedOutput": 762,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-812--41d4acf17126be09c2b49bdda762b3a60aaf5eab3117f5c4f9ad3d4a92643a6a.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-813",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "渔家傲",
      "subtitle": "每到春来长如病",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "每到春来长如病。\n玉容瘦与薄妆称。\n不惯被人抛掷。\n思当本。\n奈向后期全无定。\n早是厌厌愁欲凝。\n花间众禽愁难听。\n天赋多情翻成恨。\n有谁问。\n花屏一点炉烟暝。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "647c397e3fe0469588cde31745c7173e9884bd5478c59bf7c139ba601c14b682",
      "estimatedOutput": 760,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-813--647c397e3fe0469588cde31745c7173e9884bd5478c59bf7c139ba601c14b682.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-814",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "太史占天云物好",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "太史占天云物好，初阳律合黄锺。\n日缠南极北郊风。\n雪花先柳絮，飞舞透帘栊。\n圣运时和兼岁稔，歌欢处处皆同。\n簪声相庆晓光中。\n金炉红兽炭，一举寿杯空。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "3f4e8f2a77b65d9a4241ce6af3b5bb1873e430a8eba3c2bc435d41b112dbdb6c",
      "estimatedOutput": 750,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-814--3f4e8f2a77b65d9a4241ce6af3b5bb1873e430a8eba3c2bc435d41b112dbdb6c.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-815",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "遍地残花庭院静",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "遍地残花庭院静，流莺对对相过。\n万条风柳间婆娑。\n樱桃初弄色，萱草自成窠。\n早是芳菲时节晚，追游期会无多。\n眉山敛翠近秋波。\n日长初睡起，愁与病相和。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "a7f9d3fcfc2fc514eb318d539cca39ac62911b81a75836ff1bc29e3d0d0a2338",
